Scoped lumakey video filter

The option table, eight-bit config_input bounds (white, black, so), the
pixel_fmts list and the alpha keying and plane copy semantics in
src/video-ops/lumakey.ts follow libavfilter/vf_lumakey.c (lumakey_options,
pixel_fmts, config_input, do_lumakey_slice8, filter_frame, process_command).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
